  "title": "Squash Cookies",
  "description": "This butternut squash cookie recipe, made with brown sugar, raisins, and pecans, has a warm, spicy flavor from cinnamon, nutmeg, ginger, and allspice.",
  "authors": [
    "Francine Weston"
  ],
